# Never as a file: an `.npmrc` for a private mirror holds an auth token, and a token in a
# build context is in an image layer forever. This workspace resolves kobai through
# `workspace:*` and needs none, so unlike the Project's Dockerfile there is nothing here to
# mount it back in as — see `reference/.dockerignore`.
.npmrc
